<title>RUSSIA: Russia May industry output rises 0.2 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Russia May industry output rises 0.2 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian industrial production fell 4.1 percent in May but was 0.2 percent higher than a year earlier, the State Statistics Committee said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    RUSSIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT	MAY 97    APR 97    MAY 96</p>
<p>    month-on-month pct change	  -4.1	-3.9	-3.8</p>
<p>    year-on-year pct change	    +0.2	+0.5	-4.4</p>
<p>Note - Official Russian data tend to underreport a growing private sector in the economy.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
